<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN GAIN 181 INNINGS LEAD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN GAIN 181 INNINGS LEAD.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were all out for 430, a first innings lead of 181, on the third day of the second test against New Zealand on Saturday.</p>
</text>
